OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThursday sees rain and cloud
OL,6,Fsinking southwards across southern
OL,7,FEngland and Wales, brighter further
OL,8,Fnorth with isolated showers. In the
OL,9,Ffar south and southwest, frequent
OL,10,Fblustery and perhaps thundery showers
OL,11,Fpersist. Chillier in the north, milder
OL,12,Fin the south.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FTonight remains unsettled
OL,15,Facross the south, with further heavy
OL,16,Fshowers and outbreaks of rain. Clearer
OL,17,Fskies further north, though showers
OL,18,Fpersist along North Sea coasts,
OL,19,Fturning wintery over Scottish hills.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
