OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA crisp, frosty and bright
OL,6,Fstart on Friday. Showers persist along
OL,7,FNorth Sea coast, while rain clears the
OL,8,Fsouth through the morning. Drier
OL,9,Felsewhere, with sunny spells. Chilly
OL,10,Ffor most.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
